## Blog Schema

Required: `title` (unique), `content`. Optional: `slug`, `preview` (max 200 chars), `image: { url, publicId }`, `externalUrl`, `isPublished` (default `true`).

Tags — keep model, metadata route, admin `<select>`, and `BlogCard` styling in sync:

`LinkedIn` | `Hashnode` | `Education` | `Custom` | `Technical` (default)

Slug is auto-generated from title via `slugify` in create/update handlers — do not require clients to send it.

## API Patterns

Base path: `/api/v1/blogs`. Metadata: `/api/v1/metadata/fetch-metadata`.

| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|--------|-------|------|-------|
| GET | `/` | `optionalProtect` | Public sees only `isPublished: true`; admins see all |
| GET | `/:id` | `optionalProtect` | Single post |
| POST | `/` | `protect` | Create |
| PUT | `/:id` | `protect` | Update |
| DELETE | `/:id` | `protect` | Delete |

Response shape: `{ success: true, data, count? }`. Use `asyncHandler`; return `404` when not found.

## Metadata / LinkedIn Bridge

`POST /api/v1/metadata/fetch-metadata` with `{ url }` scrapes Open Graph tags via cheerio.

- LinkedIn login/challenge pages → return placeholder (`title: 'LinkedIn Post'`, `tag: 'LinkedIn'`, `externalUrl`) instead of 500
- Tag inference: `linkedin.com` → LinkedIn, `hashnode.com` → Hashnode, `edu`/`course` in URL → Education, else Technical
- Admin import calls this endpoint, then pre-fills the blog form

## Frontend Conventions

- API calls use relative `/api/v1/...` (Vite proxies to `localhost:5000`)
- Authenticated admin requests rely on `AuthContext` (Bearer token / cookie)
- Cover images upload via `POST /api/v1/upload` → Cloudinary; store `{ url, publicId }` on the blog
- `BlogCard` links externally when `externalUrl` is set; tag badge colors are tag-specific
- Match existing patterns: `glass` cards, `accent-orange` CTAs, Tailwind dark mode classes

## Change Checklist

When adding or renaming a blog field:

1. Update `Blog.js` schema and validators
2. Update `blogController.js` if query/filter logic changes
3. Update `AdminBlogs.jsx` form state and fields
4. Update `BlogCard` / `BlogSection` if the field is displayed
5. Update `metadataRoutes.js` only if import should populate the field

When adding a tag: update model `enum`, metadata inference, admin `<select>`, and `BlogCard` badge styles.
